  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nAll of the \"#1 Dad\" mugs in the world change to show the actual ranking of Dads suddenly. One day, Murray wakes up to find his mug says, \"#47 Dad\". He is devastated, and goes to the store to buy a new mug. He scans the shelves hoping to find one just like his kids got him last year. The shelf is full of mugs for dads, and they all say #1.  He spots the exact mug he wants to get. It's perfect. It's the same one he got last year. He picks up the mug from the shelf and carries it over to the cash register.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 14,
  "reference_text": " He looks at the price tag. The clerk tries to scan the mug, but the register makes an alert sound. The clerk looks at the screen and says, \"Sir, this mug is already registered to another customer. If you tell me your name, I'd be happy to match you to the right mug.\"",
